WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:11.841
After washing, Mandy put on clothes Rima gave her.

2
00:00:11.842 --> 00:00:17.025
She wore loose pants and a shirt that almost came to her knees.

3
00:00:17.026 --> 00:00:20.511
Vinnie also dressed in a long shirt.

4
00:00:20.512 --> 00:00:25.471
But he wore a skirt that went all the way to his ankles!

5
00:00:25.472 --> 00:00:29.591
"Time to eat," Rishi's father announced.

6
00:00:29.592 --> 00:00:33.048
The family gathered around the stove.

7
00:00:33.049 --> 00:00:36.138
Vinnie and Mandy joined them.

8
00:00:36.139 --> 00:00:41.600
Rishi's family closed their eyes and began to chant quietly.

9
00:00:41.601 --> 00:00:44.512
They put their hands together.

10
00:00:44.513 --> 00:00:49.406
Then, the family threw rice grains into the fire.

11
00:00:49.407 --> 00:00:53.808
"They're praying," whispered Mandy to Vinnie.

12
00:00:53.809 --> 00:00:58.549
After the prayer, Rishi brought out a bowl of water.

13
00:00:58.550 --> 00:01:04.132
He and Rima sat beside their father and washed his feet.

14
00:01:04.133 --> 00:01:09.220
"I guess this is a sign of respect," whispered Vinnie.

15
00:01:09.221 --> 00:01:14.738
"Maybe we should wash Dad's feet too," he joked.

16
00:01:14.739 --> 00:01:18.478
Mandy giggled.

17
00:01:18.479 --> 00:01:21.322
Finally, the food was served.

18
00:01:21.323 --> 00:01:26.220
Rishi's father sat on a mat, cross-legged on the floor.

19
00:01:26.221 --> 00:01:30.996
His wife put rice onto a large banana leaf for him.

20
00:01:30.997 --> 00:01:36.548
"Does your mother always serve your father food?" Vinnie asked Rishi.

21
00:01:36.549 --> 00:01:39.960
"Of course," he replied.

22
00:01:39.961 --> 00:01:41.766
"It is our custom.

23
00:01:41.767 --> 00:01:44.536
Now we must serve our mother."

24
00:01:44.537 --> 00:01:50.572
The children washed their hands, and their mother sat beside their father.

25
00:01:50.573 --> 00:01:55.660
Then Rishi and Rima served rice to their mother.

26
00:01:55.661 --> 00:01:59.522
"Children eat last," said Rishi.

27
00:01:59.523 --> 00:02:04.601
He gave rice to Vinnie and Mandy and they sat on a mat.

28
00:02:04.602 --> 00:02:08.629
"How do I eat this?" Mandy asked.

29
00:02:08.630 --> 00:02:11.709
She had no spoon or fork.

30
00:02:11.710 --> 00:02:17.545
"Like this," said Rima, picking up the rice with her hand.

31
00:02:17.546 --> 00:02:24.063
Vinnie and Mandy tried to copy her, but most of the rice ended up on the floor.

32
00:02:24.064 --> 00:02:28.499
Everyone laughed.

33
00:02:28.500 --> 00:02:35.953
Then, without warning, a large cow walked right into the porch!

34
00:02:35.954 --> 00:02:39.094
"Hey!" cried Mandy.

35
00:02:39.095 --> 00:02:43.085
She dropped her rice and hid behind her brother.

36
00:02:43.086 --> 00:02:45.205
"Get away! Move!"

37
00:02:45.206 --> 00:02:49.313
Vinnie got up and waved his arms at the cow.

38
00:02:49.314 --> 00:02:54.485
The cow looked at him with big, bored eyes.

39
00:02:54.486 --> 00:02:57.847
"You mustn't . . . ," Rishi cried.

40
00:02:57.848 --> 00:03:02.358
Vinnie slapped the cow's back, and it mooed loudly.

41
00:03:02.359 --> 00:03:08.255
Mandy wondered why Rishi's family wasn't doing anything.

42
00:03:08.256 --> 00:03:10.424
"Get away! Shoo!"

43
00:03:10.425 --> 00:03:15.591
Vinnie grabbed a stick lying against the wall and poked the cow.

44
00:03:15.592 --> 00:03:19.516
Suddenly, a man ran into the porch.

45
00:03:19.517 --> 00:03:22.745
He saw Vinnie poke the animal.

46
00:03:22.746 --> 00:03:27.033
"What are you doing to my cow?" he shouted.

47
00:03:27.034 --> 00:03:33.233
"Please, Babu Yadav," Rishi's father said, trying to calm the man.

48
00:03:33.234 --> 00:03:36.264
Rishi grabbed the stick from Vinnie.

49
00:03:36.265 --> 00:03:39.579
"Stop!" cried Rishi.

50
00:03:39.580 --> 00:03:43.114
"What's the matter?" asked Vinnie.

51
00:03:43.115 --> 00:03:45.463
"That boy! He hit my cow!

52
00:03:45.464 --> 00:03:49.810
I'm telling the king!" Babu Yadav shouted.

53
00:03:49.811 --> 00:03:54.686
"What is he talking about?" asked Vinnie, confused.

54
00:03:54.687 --> 00:03:58.063
"Vinnie! Cows are sacred animals.

55
00:03:58.064 --> 00:04:03.314
We never treat them badly," said Rishi.

56
00:04:03.315 --> 00:04:07.804
"Even if they come into your house?" asked Vinnie.

57
00:04:07.805 --> 00:04:14.381
"There is great punishment for those who harm cows," Rishi said seriously.

58
00:04:14.382 --> 00:04:23.330
"The king will hear about this!" Babu Yadav cried.
